\begin{align}
  n &\equiv 2094194294170672539119 \pmod{3782234599225650235415}.
  \label{eq:14prime}
\end{align}

Note that $M_{14} = 3782234599225650235415 = 5\cdot11\cdot17\cdot19\cdot23\cdot29
\cdot41\cdot47\cdot53\cdot59\cdot71\cdot83\cdot89\cdot101$
has 22 digits, and \eqref{eq:mod5}, \eqref{eq:mod11} are consequences
